<title>USA: New York Bagel names Cramer CFO.</title>
<headline>New York Bagel names Cramer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Bagel Enterprises Inc said Jon Cramer has accepted the position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The restaurant franchiser said Cramer replaced J. Chris Dennis, who resigned to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Cramer had been a senior manager at Peat Marwick LLP, New York Bagel said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
